{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-10",
  "title": "長夜終盡",
  "storyCode": "5-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eec20adaae9154db6f0be606f8f51786042a3a4e0552947eee1cfd0ae769bae0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你要出手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "只要在這裡殺死我，這裡的所有整合運動都會因此崩潰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "如果你拒絕和我對話，那真的很不幸。請吧，殺死我，如果你做得到的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "陳sir！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "敵人的攻勢非常猛烈！我們要速戰速決，不能再拖了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "兩方的指揮官只有一個能活下來，非常簡單明瞭的局面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我的遺言不會太長，長官。只要你能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你覺得你是什麼，殉道者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你死後沒人會紀念你。受死和受尊重是兩回事，這取決於你的所作所為，而不是死法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我當然想和有價值的敵人博弈，然後有價值地死去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "看來你是無法幫我達成願望了。你會一敗塗地，長官。現在輪到我來指出你的處境了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的自信建立在切爾諾伯格的隕落之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但這裡不是切爾諾伯格，不是烏薩斯人無情的惡土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "強韌的龍門不會在你這種小卒手中陷落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "說得很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "【咆哮】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "斬擊？不，不可能！這難道是......法術？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "向後退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "呃......怎麼會？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "【痛苦的呻吟】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "別害怕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "不會痛的，不要害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "【呻吟】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（太遠了。想再向前挪步又相當困難，消耗戰對我不利。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "真是強大的技巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你的法術提前觸爆了浮士德的攻擊，甚至洞穿了我佈設的陣型，劃痕從第一位護衛頸間一直蔓延到我面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "再讓你上前幾步，我一定會被你撕成兩段。就連浮士德也沒法阻止你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "下一次你就沒這麼幸運了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "很可惜，你無能為力。你的秘密已經曝光了，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "拙劣的戲法一般只表演一次，因為表演完畢後，它們不會剩下什麼秘密。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我們之間的距離超出了你法術的範圍，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "天台只有這點大小。你沒幾步可退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "可你又能向前幾步呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，讓她見識一下什麼叫真正的魔術。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的位置我一清二楚。暴露了的狙擊手是沒有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "真厲害啊，陳長官。無論是什麼弩彈你都能切碎嗎？而我和剛才一樣，根本什麼都沒看清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "狙擊手，我同時遭到了來自你和三點鐘方向的狙擊，但那個方向沒有任何敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你不可能是那種術師。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "不用費盡心思去猜了，長官，你猜不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "接下來，你能截住幾發弩彈？十發？四十發？百發？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但是，碎片呢？衝擊呢？弩彈裡蘊含的源石技藝呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "難道這些你也能全部截住嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "廢話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那就再來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "長官，我知道你是什麼。我的源石技藝只對感染者有效果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你知道你只會成為他們的棋子，然後被他們隨手丟棄嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這句話，我原封不動地還給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我們會給你機會，龍門卻不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "陳長官，我們可能要被迫向下轉移了！敵人的攻勢太猛烈了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（嘁，一旦我想要移動，弩彈就會從四面八方射來，敵人的狙擊手究竟是怎麼做到的？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（半寸出鞘僅僅只能清掃狙擊手的攻擊，但再這樣消耗下去，我遲早氣短力盡。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（我必須在一瞬間裡分出勝負......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "無論你還想說些什麼，我都沒時間再聽下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "（紅色在她身邊凝聚，這是施術的前兆。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "（梅菲斯特，按照計畫，現在射擊她，她必須中斷施術，或者，她 會在爆炸中死去。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "可這難道不是挫去她銳氣的最好機會嗎？先等等，你就好好看著吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "我們會錯失良機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "戰略的目標比戰術更重要，浮士德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "和我一起走！別再留在這裡了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你難道不想離開這裡嗎，離這些人、這個地方遠遠的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你是不是不知道？大人們那麼對待你和我，全都怪他！全都是他的錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我恨這座城市。我恨他。別讓我也恨你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "赤霄——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——拔刀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "所有護衛，並行！擋住她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "【尖嘯】",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（不，不行！赤霄失控了？怎麼偏偏在這時候！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "法術凝滯了。她沒能成功施術。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，現在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "命令，射擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "可惡......散出！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "真是把強大的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "僅僅是溢散的法術，竟然能把所有箭矢弩彈一掃而空，甚至還剝奪了三個護衛的行動能力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "但你也被衝擊擊中了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "哈，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "（一根，不，兩根肋骨？還能忍住。但這樣強勁的火力和來源，我根本......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "就和領袖說的一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "長官，你不是不想殺死我，你是沒辦法拔出那把劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你再說一遍，是誰，說了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你知道那個名字的，陳長官。這把劍，就像你說的，不是用來對抗我的，你的衝動損壞了它的運作方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "如果我們抓住你完全缺乏防備的那刻，你已經化成粉末了。她完全知曉你的弱點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "花言巧語。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我們要摧毀這片大地現在的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "若放任腐敗繼續滋長，整片大地都會陷落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "只有摧毀這一切，無數銹蝕的城市才能打破枷鎖，甚至是重生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "（嘶嚎）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "礙事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "來吧，陳長官。你對龍門也很失望吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "而我們的領袖在等你。何況你並沒有為龍門服務的立場吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我有職責在身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那和立場無關。你所說的都是些世俗雜務，你知道他們是怎麼對待我們的同胞們的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "只要你給我一點示意，我就會立刻停手。來，加入我們，讓我們為更偉大的目標服務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "啐。我能給你的就只有這口血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "有你這種人在，整合運動會是在實踐什麼高尚理念？我不相信！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這樣啊。如果你不相信，那就算了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你可以好好掙扎一下。我的護衛和他的弩彈會讓你見證感染者真正的力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你孤身一人，而我們既團結又強大，你死得其所。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這些話可以留到你死後慢慢說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "或者，你可以強行催化那把劍上凝聚著的源石技藝。那會發生很可怕的事吧？你的命運由你自己決定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你想死得像個英雄？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "小子，人死了什麼都不會剩下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "如果殺掉你意味著我需要和你同歸於盡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "雖然不值得，但我可以做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我們的之間的談話結束了。再見，陳長官。浮士德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "命令，射——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不用做到那步，陳長官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "那是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "直升機？不，這不像直升機，這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "煌，跳吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "注意落地姿勢，別離開我的熱流！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "那是什麼？有人從上面跳下來了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“恐懼升騰，她終將盲目——”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "咳，羅德島？從天上？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "這些黑色的線條......怎麼回事，難道是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“——淚水乾涸，她慟哭無聲。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "唔，嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "text": "嗚......嗚！嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "怎麼回事？我的護衛怎麼會發出這種悲鳴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "為什麼，我的法術早就該磨滅了他們的情感啊，怎麼回事，怎麼回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "是你嗎！！你！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "羅德島的兔子！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我限制了他們的活動，不過一次也只能持續十幾秒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "夠了，夠我創造出安全區了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "動手吧，煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "準備好大幹一場了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "要落地了，屁股會有點疼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "接好我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "當然！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "命令，射擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別小看人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "——弩彈被風偏移了？難道——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "劃開屋頂，讓其他的整合運動全掉下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒問題，但你一定得穩住！這招我幾個月也只能用一次！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "唔，唔唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "text": "唔啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "近衛局的頂樓被切出了巨大的裂痕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道，你們小心坍塌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "怎麼回事？怎麼做到的？發生了什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "哎，大量的整合運動也一同掉到這層樓裡了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "不管了，大家撐住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "喂，喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你用不著那麼快就趕著去死吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這麼關鍵的時刻，你在通訊頻道裡搞什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哎，我的任務完成了，我來告訴你一聲而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "羅德島有架很厲害的東西，靠那個，她們應該馬上就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "已經到了。你的任務是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "接應羅德島啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "安全落地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "煌，放我下來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你......你們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陳長官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "阿米婭......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "抱歉陳長官，我們來晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "依照協議，現在是羅德島支援你的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數分鐘前\n04:21 A.M.  天氣/多雲\n龍門上城區，“壞傢伙”號，近衛局大樓上空40米處"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好了，到你們大顯身手的時候了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "你這是在熱情高漲個什麼勁啊，她之前可是把阿米婭丟在廢城不管，現在不正該讓她好好嘗嘗孤立無援的滋味嗎？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "煌，別這樣。Dr.{@nickname}是對的。我們必須先解決龍門的問題。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "否則，羅德島迄今以來的所有付出都會白費。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "行吧，如果是命令的話，我接受。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......去吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "我知道。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "但說實話，我並不想幫這個傢伙。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "煌，我們不能讓羅德島三個月來的努力白白流失。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "經濟效益是吧，得了，我做就是了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "有些事，等到龍門安全了再討論也不遲。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "那到時候，我們可要撈很大一筆傭金才行！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "看她那狼狽的樣子。去幫幫她，阿米婭。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "我們看起來可是比她還要破破爛爛啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "好煩，我都沒想到廢城裡的那個傢伙居然那麼囂張，凱爾希根本沒提醒過我啊......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "等回羅德島，我請你吃咖哩。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "回去以後，我們就能好好休息了。但首先，我們要把這場戰鬥徹底結束掉。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "行，就這麼定了，上吧！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "你們怎麼會在這？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "我們必須在這，梅菲斯特。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "霜星在幹什麼！那個傢伙怎麼回事，難道又昏死過去了嗎！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "你這隻兔子，你們羅德島，不早該被凍死在切城了嗎！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "我還不能死。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "只要這片大地上還有礦石病帶來的災難，我們的戰鬥就永無休止。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "無論是你這樣的狂人還是感染者遭遇的不公，我們都會一個接一個的剷除！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "哈，哈哈......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "來啊小兔子，如果你的敵人是我，就殺了我吧！現在！殺掉我！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "不。你不是我的敵人。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "那我就殺掉你！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "你想光榮地死去，你不會得逞。我要消滅的只是你的仇恨和惡毒。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "你會怎麼樣根本不關我的事。看看這些感染者。你的死不能帶來任何東西。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "你——",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "我不會在你這樣的人身上浪費情感，至少，不是現在。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "你想徹底與整合運動為敵嗎？你想嘗嘗感染者真正的憤怒嗎？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "感染者是不同的。霜星小姐和你沒有任何相似之處，整合運動並不都是你這樣的人。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "她和你說了什麼？這個女人......！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "你是不是弄錯了什麼？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
              "text": "我才是那個能控制住各個城市的人，我才是能夠控制住那些普通人的人！不是她！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "所以，如果需要有人去懲罰你和你的惡行，我義不容辭！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "是啊，而且敵對什麼的，我們不是早就敵對了嗎？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "對！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "從你們開始製造恐怖和慘劇的那一步開始，我們就已經是敵人了！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "——",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "阿米婭。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "陳長官，請再撐一會兒。羅德島的支援小隊也在接近這裡。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "對不起。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "啊？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "......戰場很吵雜，我沒能聽見作戰計畫，陳長官。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "呵。我知道了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "請說吧，陳長官。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "炎國有句古話，“擒賊先擒王”。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "意思是，想要消滅敵人，就先要抓住敵人的指揮官。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "小心點，他那些沒有理智的手下，會不斷地被他重新驅趕進戰場。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "陳",
              "text": "可以的話，去幫他們從這種痛苦中解脫。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "......明白。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "text": "博士。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我明白。你和煌去戰鬥，我來指揮。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "嗯！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "煌，我用法術摧毀敵人的陣型，你去逼退他們的攻勢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我們要給陳長官爭取空間！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "她是很強，但她真有那麼強嗎？直接拿下那兩個小子？我有點不放心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我相信博士的指揮能幫她做到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "接下來，我要突襲敵方的指揮官。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "幫你打開通道對吧，沒問題！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你需要一個擒下對方指揮官的契機。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "哼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "不管怎麼樣，我相信你一次。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也可以相信你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "和龍門聯手嗎，羅德島。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "現在親眼見到，我才感到這帶給感染者的恥辱有多深重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "四個人就把你逼到這種地步，要說可恥，你才是該感到羞恥的那個吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "梅菲斯特，我們會在這裡掐斷你的惡行！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "text": "浮士德！把這些人，全都，全都從我的面前清除！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "浮士德",
          "text": "......是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "這場戰鬥該結束了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "只有這樣，下一場惡戰才會開始。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "下令，Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島，聽我指揮。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "協助陳長官，奪回近衛局大樓！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    }
  ]
}
